! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''da'e''

;__da'e__ (KOhA2): eventual utterance -- pro-sumti: remote future utterance; "He'll tell you tomorrow. IT will be a doozy." --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''da'e'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''da'u''

;__da'u__ (KOhA2): earlier utterance -- pro-sumti: a remote past utterance; "She couldn't have known that IT would be true." --
