!! cmavo: di'u (KOhA2)

!!! Proposed definition:
A pro-sumti referring to the previous utterence.

!!! See also
* da'e
* da'u
* de'e
* de'u
* dei
* di'e
* do'i

!! Proposed keywords
* that (just said)

!!! Usage examples
;do na nelci loi mlatu: "You don't like cats."
;.i di'u jitfa jufra: "That (which you just said) is untrue."

!!! Notes
Is often used with {la'e}:
;lo termarxa doi .imos. .i xu do djica la'e di'u .i lo termarxa: "Pulp, Emo! Is that what you want, pulp?"
!! Examples of ''di'u'' Usage

